[h1]⭐ [THE ASCENSION ERA] - Cosmic Overhaul Update 5.0.0! ⭐[/h1]

[hr][/hr]

[h3]📡 What's New in The Ascension Era?[/h3]
Welcome to the biggest Overhaul update ever! Version 5.0.0 completely reinvents the mid-to-late game economy, introduces brutal dynamic weather hazards, and brings unparalleled Quality of Life to your massive fleets.

[b]⚠️ NEW SAVE FILE HARD REQUIRED ⚠️[/b]
Ascendancy dependencies and massive structural overhauls requires a new galaxy.

[hr][/hr]

✅ [b]NEW MECHANICS, FEATURES & CONTENT[/b]
[list]
[*]🧠 [b]Ascendant Neural Implants:[/b] Transform your flagship! Equip legendary Ascendant subsystems that fuse your captain with the ship, granting god-tier scaling multipliers like jump reach, fighters, and extreme velocity.
[*]🌩️ [b]Dynamic Subspace Weather:[/b] Travel is no longer safe. Dynamic Ion Storms (disables radar/hyperspace) and Solar Flares (strips shields/hulls) ravage sectors. Navigating through hazards delays offline commands by 50% unless piloted by an Explorer or Navigator.
[*]👑 [b]Station Governors:[/b] Put your idle Captains to work! Assigning a Governor to your stations grants massive buffs. (e.g., Smugglers bypass siege blockades, Merchants slash crew hiring costs by 50% and boost passive income).
[*]🏅 [b]Captain Elite Traits:[/b] Level 3 Captains now possess massive sector-wide or unique bonuses (e.g., Commodores provide +10% Shield/Damage to player/alliance ships, Miners gain +25 area command bonus).
[*]📉 [b]Deep Economy Warfare:[/b] Localized Famine Events force starving factions to declare war on wealthy neighbors! Factions suffering from Severe Famine receive a devastating 60% shield debuff and 40% velocity penalty to all ships.
[*]🛑 [b]Siege & War Zone Blockades:[/b] Stations in active Cosmic War zones suspend all background AI Trader traffic and reject docking requests. If defenders are outgunned 2:1, factory production halts entirely until the siege is lifted.
[*]💼 [b]Syndicate Smuggler Rework & Hub Expansion:[/b] The Black Market is a massive enterprise! Fence classified Eclipse/Rift tech for a massive 200-300% premium! Passive unbranding generates "Syndicate Heat" that triggers brutal punitive raids if neglected.
[*]🛠️ [b]Fleet Repair Terminal:[/b] Instantly repair your entire Private and Alliance fleet in the sector simultaneously with a single button click at Repair Docks!
[*]⛏️ [b]Persistent Resource Regeneration:[/b] Stripped asteroid fields now regenerate naturally over real-time! Severe Famine pauses the ecology, and completely barren sectors may spawn an "Emergency Replenishment" anomaly event!
[*]🚀 [b]Gate Travel Priority:[/b] Map enchaining now correctly routes ships through Gate Networks and Wormholes instead of blindly hyper-jumping across the galaxy.
[*]⌨️ [b]CCM Keybind API:[/b] Assign custom hotkeys to instantly toggle the Bulletin Board and Resource Display panels without clicking through station menus!
[*]📖 [b]Cosmic Codex & Wiki Integration:[/b] The mod now fully supports the Cosmic Codex! 43+ articles of lore, mechanics, and synergies natively readable directly in-game.
[*]👻 [b]Sealed Hulks (Boarding Operations):[/b] Deep space hidden mass sectors now have a chance to generate a massive "Sealed Hulk." Risk your crew in interactive text events for Legendary subsystem drops!
[*]🔍 [b]Scout & Emergency Anomalies:[/b] Explorer Captains charting empty sectors leave notes hinting at Cosmic Chronicles events. Emergency Replenishments have a chance to unearth Precursor Wrecks or Spatial Rifts!
[*]🏪 [b]Shop Restock Button:[/b] Natively refresh inventories at Equipment Docks and Merchants without closing the window!
[*]🗑️ [b]Scrapyard Freedom:[/b] Time limits and tedious restrictions at Scrapyards have been completely eradicated!
[*]📛 [b]NPC Naming & AI Overhaul:[/b] NPC ship names scale dynamically based on volume. Factions now organically calculate AI routines using a robust new tag-based AI (Aggressive, Passive, Trader) rather than static tables.
[*]😨 [b]Ascendancy Trade Fear:[/b] Merchant trade flights take 20% longer if the target faction is at war with the Ascendancy (The Eclipse). Smugglers natively bypass this!
[*]🔌 [b]Cosmic Vault API Framework:[/b] Fully integrated with the new framework. Swept codebase for legacy callbacks and implemented safe pcall fallbacks.
[/list]

⚙️ [b]CHANGED & BALANCED[/b]
[list]
[*]📰 [b]Unified News API:[/b] Ambient events and galactic occurrences are securely routed through the new architecture for cross-mod UI stability.
[*]🔗 [b]Core Dependencies:[/b] Core 5 mods are now hard requirements for maximum stability.
[*]📈 [b]Dynamic Trade Pricing:[/b] Trading with a Famine-struck faction now yields up to 2.5x more passive profit.
[*]💰 [b]War Profiteering:[/b] Supplying 100% Heat War Zones now yields a massive 250% income bonus!
[*]📉 [b]Reputation Decay Scaling:[/b] Halved the base Dynamic Reputation Decay rate to 50/hr to synergize with Cosmic Ascendancy endgame campaigns.
[*]🤝 [b]Alliance Mirroring Parity:[/b] Scaled diplomatic rep gain mirroring for Alliances down to 1x to prevent "cascade wars". Penalty increases if attacking a Fortified faction.
[*]🎲 [b]Loot Variance Boost:[/b] Pushed the unseeded wild-generation chance for Exotic and Legendary drops to 75% for enhanced endgame loot variety.
[*]❤️ [b]Famine Relief Charity:[/b] Background Charity Missions sent to famished factions natively grant a +50% Reputation multiplier.
[*]♻️ [b]Siege Salvage Yield:[/b] Scavenger captains actively flying inside a Contested Siege Zone get a +20% Salvage Yield buff.
[*]🤫 [b]Smuggler Deflation:[/b] Idling Smuggler captains passively heal the controlling faction's Famine Score over time.
[*]⏱️ [b]Galactic Turn Synchronization:[/b] Synced intervals to 20 minutes to align with the global server turn, massively reducing asynchronous micro-stutters.
[*]⚖️ [b]Economic Stabilization:[/b] Base payouts strictly doubled to compensate for the 20-minute interval changes, keeping the economy perfectly balanced without punishing players.
[/list]

🐛 [b]BUG FIXES & OPTIMIZATION[/b]
[list]
[*]⚡ [b]Performance & TPS Optimization:[/b] Drastically reduced server load! Throttled update intervals on major AI/UI scripts to prevent industrialized sectors from dragging down TPS.
[*]💥 [b]Engine Crash Fixes:[/b] Fixed multiple API Avorion Indexes that caused C++ crashes (corrected stat modifiers, invalid faction setters, matching distance checks).
[*]🔒 [b]Multiplayer Desyncs:[/b] Safely replaced all `math.random` instances with deterministic `random():getInt()` to prevent server physics and stats desyncs.
[*]🧮 [b]RNG Calculation Math Bug:[/b] Replaced critical logic faults in Station Governors and AI Traders for exact percentage math on random economic events.
[*]🤝 [b]Alliance Ghost Ship Fix:[/b] Patched a critical UI thread crash inside background handlers when tracking Alliance commands.
[*]🐞 [b]Scout Mission Fix:[/b] Scouts will no longer completely ignore Faction HQ sectors!
[*]🛡️ [b]VM Isolation Reputation Bug:[/b] Completely refactored Dynamic Reputation Decay, extracting isolated hooks into a global override.
[*]🗺️ [b]Map UI & Trading Manager Spam:[/b] Eliminated the "Activity level is zero" console spam and removed broken command hooks causing Map UI crashes.
[*]🧠 [b]Memory Leaks & UI Crashes:[/b] Sealed memory leaks by injecting `onRemove()` functions into UI scripts. Reinstated missing UI labels to prevent merchant crashes.
[*]📜 [b]Script Execution Faults:[/b] Fixed missing return statements and out-of-bounds indices in player station scripts.
[*]🌐 [b]Multiplayer Networking & Stability:[/b] Added missing `callable()` declarations to Factory upgrades and `onClient()` wrappers to Stash/Map scripts for Dedicated Server stability.

